---
title: 子狐は妖狐が退場しても follow-fox-death trait を持たないため後追いしない
setup: { kogitsune: 1, werehamster: 1, werewolf: 1, villager: 2 }
rules:
  first-victim: none
---
# Day 1 投票で Bob (妖狐) を処刑。 背徳者は不在のため follow_kill は発生しないが、
# 子狐 (Alice) も follow-fox-death trait を持たないため Alice は生存。
# Day 2 で Carol (狼) を処刑し、 Alice (子狐) のみ生存 → hamster_won。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave、Eve
!Alice=子狐
!Bob=妖狐
!Carol=人狼
!Dave=村人
!Eve=村人

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Bob
Carol→Bob
Dave→Bob
Eve→Bob
Bob→Carol

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Bob 4 / Carol 1 → execution=Bob
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Day 2:

Alice→Carol
Dave→Carol
Eve→Carol
Carol→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 ==
# vote tally: Carol 3 / Alice 1 → execution=Carol
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: werehamster_won
# survivors: Alice, Dave, Eve
# == end ==

# @expect-status Alice: alive
# @expect-status Bob: dead
# @expect-status Carol: dead
# @expect-result: werehamster_won
